## Version 1.1.1

- Restores the main window's size and on-screen position after closing.
- Replaces window size presets with 50%, 75%, and 100% of each layout's base size.
- Scales Compact and Statistics layout overlay text for smaller window sizes.
- Renamed Style tab to Skins.
- Fixed some errors
- Adds new Nomenclatures (naming system):
    - Default: Daniel's default naming with three subdivisions, DP: 12.08 = Low-Beta
    - MMA: Based on LeoBlack's Mania Map Analizer naming with five subdivisions, DP: 12.08 = Beta mid
    - --/++: Uses only dan name and a symbol with five subdivisions, DP: 12.08 = Beta--
    - Mania tracker: Uses [Mania tracker](https://mania-tracker.com) naming with five subdivisions, DP: 12.08= Beta Low
    - Images: Uses Mania tracker dan images and five subdivisions.


## Version 1.1

- Clears stale Etterna bridge state on startup so the previous chart is not shown.
- Remembers the last selected layout.
- Adds Small / Medium / Large preset window sizes in Options. (WIP)
- Text automatically shrinks when the window is too narrow.
- The strain graph keeps updating even when is not visible in the current layout.
- New Style tab in options (empty for now).
- The Options window is resizable, remembers its last size, and the text scales with the window.
- Keybinds are focus-only by default, with a new option to behave as it did in version 1.0.


